[Parser]
	- Enums
	- Error System

[Errors]
	- Panic Mode for Topmost
	- Handling Error Tokens
	- Phrase Level Recovery / Error Productions

	- Fatal (Crash) / Extant (Preserve the Error)
	- Pass in a span + "flt" variant (often a discriminated union), further allows attatching info/hint as well as change spans, for lints, allows for changing severity
	- Assembly at error_printing time, after refining for duplicates using _
	- Error Entries -> Parent Struct to reduce locks
	- Use hashing to filter dupicates

	- Error: DiagCtxHandle, E_Metadata
	- E_Metadata: Level, grace?, message (returned by flt::), error code(returned by flt::), span (multi span),
	  children (info/hint), args for flt
	- Diag (Parent - Errors): _

[Error System]
	- (Level) Errors (Hardcoded) vs lints/warnings (allow, warn, deny)
	- Lints (Types) : Lint | Grace Lint
	- Format
	- Use Ftl
	- readability of messages
	- additional info/hint
	- highlighted code blocks
	- "Allow thing-not-concept"

